  "pli-tv-kd22:1.10.13": "Sp-ṭ 1.0: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Siṅgena loṇaṁ pariharitvā pariharitvā aloṇakapiṇḍapātena saddhiṁ bhuñjituṁ kappati, na sannidhiṁ karotīti adhippāyo</i>, “Carrying salt in a horn here and there, is it allowable to eat it together with unsalted almsfood? The meaning is one should not store it.” ",
