  "pli-tv-kd22:2.8.20": "Literally, “This is the first voting ticket that I place.” ",
  "pli-tv-kd22:2.8.21": "“Is it allowable to eat at the wrong time, so long as the shadow of the sundial is within two fingerbreadths of midday?” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>kappati, bhante, dvaṅgulāya chāyāya vītivattāya vikāle bhojanaṁ bhuñjituni</i>. More literally this might be rendered as follows: “When two fingerbreadths of shade have passed, is it allowable to eat at the wrong time?” I interpret this to mean within two fingerbreadths of midday. ",
