  "pli-tv-kd22:2.8.45": "“What’s connected to the observance-day ceremony” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>uposathasaṁyutta</i>, which is identified at Sp-ṭ 4.457 as the Uposathakkhandhaka, The Chapter on the Observance Day. But perhaps it is better regarded as a <i lang='pi' translate='no'>forerunner</i> to the Uposathakkhandhaka. ",
