  "pli-tv-kd22:2.8.104": "“The rule concerning cutting” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>chedanake pācittiyaṁ</i>. Sp 4.457: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Chedanakasikkhāpade vuttapācittiyaṁ āpajjatīti attho</i>, “The meaning is he commits the said offense entailing confession in the training rule on cutting.” This refers to <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc89/en/brahmali#2.10.1'>Bu Pc 89</a>. ",
